            "brand_button_background": "#e83e8c",
            "brand_button_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "heading": "Payment Methods",
            "content": "<p><strong>Prepaid — 5% OFF</strong></p><p>Pay via UPI, cards, net banking or wallets and get an extra 5% off, applied automatically at checkout. Secure and encrypted — we never store your card details.</p><p><strong>Partial Cash on Delivery</strong></p><p>Pay a small advance online and the rest in cash on delivery. COD orders carry a Rs 40 handling charge and do not qualify for the 5% prepaid discount. The advance is non-refundable if the order is refused.</p><p><strong>Good to Know</strong></p><ul><li>Flat Rs 99 shipping on all orders.</li><li>Payment issue? WhatsApp <a href=\"https://wa.me/918584072905\">+91 85840 72905</a> or email <a href=\"mailto:info@cocopoco.in\">info@cocopoco.in</a>.</li></ul><p><strong>Prepaid vs COD (on a Rs 1,000 order)</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Order value:</strong> Rs 1,000 for both prepaid and COD.</li><li><strong>Prepaid:</strong> Rs 50 discount, Rs 99 shipping — you pay Rs 1,049.</li><li><strong>COD:</strong> Rs 40 COD charge, Rs 99 shipping — you pay Rs 1,139.</li></ul><p><br/><strong>That's Rs 90 saved</strong> just by <strong>paying online</strong> — plus faster dispatch and no cash to arrange at the door. <strong>The bigger the order, the more you save.</strong></p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          }
